# Rune-Brand Juggler: the cost is "Sacrifice a suspected creature" (CR 118.3): with the Juggler declining to suspect anything, no creature Bot1
# controls is suspected, so the ability is refused even with {3}{B}{R} available and Bot2's Ornithopter a legal target; nothing is sacrificed.
# The sibling scenario, with the Memnite suspected, is the positive control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Rune-Brand Juggler
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
